description_text:
Medieval castle kit the perfect package for creating medieval castles. 
The package contains about 100 modular prefabs, that will allow you to create and customize your castle. 
The package also contains a decal system which allows you to paint textures using vertices. 
Features: 

  - PBR materials;

  - 4K textures;

  - Modular components;

Modular Dock system is a collection of 3D models that allows you to build docks.It includes 3 bridges,  13 dock pieces and 2 poles.
Features:

  - 4K textures;

  - LOD levels;

  - customized colliders;

Rendered images in Substance Painter and Marmoset Toolbag 4 with 4k textures.

Textures resolution is from 1024x1024 to 4096x4096, 8 bits + dithering.

Model consists of 2 normal maps which including:

  - Textures PBR metallic roughnes;

  - Textures for UnrealEngine4;

  - Textures for Unity5.

3D Models consists of:

  - verts: 4360;

  - faces: 4190;

  - tris: 8348.

Including BLEND, USD, FBX and OBJ formats.

Created in Blender v.2.93.4.

